{"id": "3254126", "revid": "322190", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3254126", "title": "Ion D. Scorei (Sicore I.D.)", "text": "= Date esen\u021biale \u0219i identitate =\nNume complet: Ion D. Scorei (pseudonim literar: Sicore I.D.).\nData \u0219i locul na\u0219terii: 16 ianuarie 1932, T\u0103m\u0103\u0219e\u0219tii de Jos, fosta comun\u0103 Ceauru \u2014 ast\u0103zi comuna B\u0103le\u0219ti, jude\u021bul Gorj, Rom\u00e2nia.\nOcupa\u021bii: poet, eseist, publicist; animator cultural al Cenaclului literar\u2011artistic \u201eIon Minulescu\u201d din Bumbe\u0219ti\u2011Jiu (conducere continu\u0103 \u00eencep\u00e2nd cu 1980).\nA murit la 1 decembrie 2018.\n= Formare, studii \u0219i carier\u0103 profesional\u0103 (cronologie detaliat\u0103 1945\u20131991) =\n1945 \u2014 \u00eencheie cele \u0219apte clase primare \u00een satul natal, T\u0103m\u0103\u0219e\u0219tii de Jos.\n1946\u20131948 \u2014 elev la \u0219coala profesional\u0103 de contabili cooperatori (T\u00e2rgu\u2011Jiu), \u00eenfiin\u021bat\u0103 de Institutul Na\u021bional al Coopera\u021biei pe l\u00e2ng\u0103 fosta Federa\u021bie \u00abGorjul\u00bb; absolvire \u00een mai 1948.\n1948\u20131952 \u2014 \u00eencadrat pe func\u021bii contabile \u00een cadrul Uniunii Jude\u021bene a Cooperativelor de Consum Gorj; deprinde instrumentarul contabilit\u0103\u021bii publice/cooperative, audit \u0219i proceduri de control.\n1952 (iunie) \u2014 transfer la Uzinele Mecanice Sadu (UM Sadu), unde activeaz\u0103 p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een mai 1991, pe linie financiar\u2011economic\u0103.\n1961 \u2014 absolv\u0103 \u0218coala Tehnic\u0103 Financiar\u0103 (Bucure\u0219ti).\n1971 \u2014 absolv\u0103 Facultatea de Drept, Universitatea din Bucure\u0219ti (specializarea \u0218tiin\u021be juridice).\n~1965\u20131991 \u2014 coordoneaz\u0103 peste 25 de ani Serviciul de Control Financiar Intern (CFI) la UM Sadu: organizarea controlului preventiv, monitorizarea bugetelor, verificarea stocurilor, audit\u0103ri interne periodice, conformare procedural\u0103 \u0219i raportare c\u0103tre conducere.\n1991 (mai) \u2014 pensionare pentru limit\u0103 de v\u00e2rst\u0103.\n= Intrare \u00een via\u021ba literar\u0103 \u0219i debuturi =\nDebut \u00een reviste: 1987 \u2014 \u00abConvorbiri literare\u00bb (ianuarie), \u00abFamilia\u00bb (august \u0219i decembrie).\nDebut editorial: 1993 \u2014 placheta de versuri \u00abC\u0103r\u0103mizi pentru o catedral\u0103\u00bb (Editura Spicon, T\u00e2rgu\u2011Jiu), \u00een colec\u021bia \u00abCele mai frumoase poezii\u00bb.\nPrezen\u021be ulterioare (constant sau cu intermiten\u021be) \u00een reviste centrale: \u00abRamuri\u00bb, \u00abLuceaf\u0103rul\u00bb, \u00abSuplimentul literar\u00bb, \u00abRom\u00e2nia literar\u0103\u00bb, al\u0103turi de publica\u021bii culturale regionale.\n= Animator cultural: Cenaclul \u00abIon Minulescu\u00bb \u0219i revista \u00abPuls\u00bb =\nAnii 1970 \u2014 \u00eencepe activitatea \u00een cadrul Cenaclului literar\u2011artistic \u00abIon Minulescu\u00bb (Bumbe\u0219ti\u2011Jiu).\n1980 \u2014 reorganizeaz\u0103 statutar cenaclul \u0219i preia conducerea, pe care o va exercita ne\u00eentrerupt. Devine mentor \u0219i vector organizatoric al vie\u021bii literare locale.\nDup\u0103 1989 \u2014 sub egida cenaclului, apare periodic revista de cultur\u0103 \u00abPuls\u00bb, revitaliz\u00e2nd tradi\u021bia presei culturale gorjene inaugurat\u0103 la finele secolului al XIX\u2011lea de Gheorghe Dumitrescu\u2011Bumbe\u0219ti.\n1995 \u2014 \u00eengrije\u0219te antologia \u00ab\u00cen centrul luminii\u00bb, considerat\u0103 prima antologie de acest tip \u00een Gorj dup\u0103 1989, reunind voci ale membrilor cenaclului \u0219i ale colaboratorilor.\n= Colabor\u0103ri \u00een presa local\u0103 \u0219i central\u0103 =\nPresa gorjean\u0103 post\u20111989: \u00abGorjeanul\u00bb, \u00abDiminea\u021ba Gorjului\u00bb, \u00abJurnalul de Gorj\u00bb, \u00abOpinia\u00bb, \u00abCurierul minier\u00bb, \u00abMesager\u00bb, \u00abObiectiv gorjean\u00bb, \u00abTimpul de Gorj\u00bb, \u00abImpact \u00een Gorj\u00bb, \u00abInforma\u021bia Gorjului\u00bb.\nPublica\u021bii de cultur\u0103: \u00abPuls\u00bb, \u00abCaietele Columna\u00bb, \u00abAger\u00bb, \u00abCuget liber\u00bb, \u00abMiracol de Br\u0103diceni\u00bb. La \u00abCurierul minier\u00bb \u0219i \u00abJurnalul de Gorj\u00bb semneaz\u0103 inclusiv ca redactor.\nRubrici notabile: \u00abEseul s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2nii\u00bb, \u00abDin col\u021bul ironistului\u00bb (\u00een special \u00een \u00abTimpul de Gorj\u00bb), cu profil civic, etic \u0219i educativ.\n= Opera publicat\u0103 \u2014 analiz\u0103 detaliat\u0103 (f\u0103r\u0103 lucr\u0103ri anun\u021bate) =\nPoezie, haiku, sonet.\n\u2022 \u00abC\u0103r\u0103mizi pentru o catedral\u0103\u00bb (poezie, Editura Spicon, 1993) \u2014 volum de debut; lirism reflexiv, etic\u0103 a cuv\u00e2ntului, minu\u021bie \u00een construc\u021bia imaginii. Ion \u0218oldea remarc\u0103 \u00abc\u0103utarea neobosit\u0103 de pepite ale propriilor cuvinte\u00bb \u0219i \u0219lefuirea expresiei p\u00e2n\u0103 la esen\u021b\u0103.\n\u2022 \u00abCe vede piatra\u00bb (haiku, Editura Alexandru \u0218tefulescu, 1997) \u2014 prefa\u021b\u0103: Ion Popescu\u2011Br\u0103diceni. Poetul\u2011haijin practic\u0103 fenomenologia discret\u0103 a naturii \u0219i \u00abgeometriile lucide\u00bb ale miniaturii; fuziunea dintre fueki (stabilitate) \u0219i ry\u016bko (curgere) sus\u021bine iluminarea (kairos).\n\u2022 \u00abAlfabetul umbrei\u00bb (poezie, Editura Agora, 1999) \u2014 extinde temele memoriei, interiorit\u0103\u021bii \u0219i eticii civic\u2011morale; dic\u021biune epurat\u0103, cu economii lexicale semnificative.\n\u2022 \u00abFulgere fr\u00e2nte\u00bb (haiku, Editura Agora, 2001) \u2014 aproape 1.000 de haiku\u2011uri; sintez\u0103 major\u0103 a practicii formei scurte. Concentrarea imaginii \u0219i a sensului e dublat\u0103 de un filon medita\u021bional pronun\u021bat.\n\u2022 \u00abMuntele rotund. C\u0103l\u0103tor \u00een iluzie\u00bb (antologie haiku, edi\u021bie bilingv\u0103 ro/en, Editura Info, 2003; traducere: Silviu Doina\u0219 Popescu) \u2014 \u00abminiaturi pre\u021bioase\u00bb, axate pe medita\u021bie, reculegere spiritual\u0103 \u0219i puritate a ritmurilor interioare (aprecieri critice).\n\u2022 \u00abOntosoneta. Oglinzi mi\u0219cate pe t\u0103i\u0219ul clipei\u00bb (sonete, Editura Info, 2004) \u2014 peste 200 de sonete; arhitectur\u0103 clasic\u0103, cu reflec\u021bii asupra timpului, memoriei, imagina\u021biei; George Manoiu insist\u0103 asupra raport\u0103rii la \u00abscurgerea implacabil\u0103 a timpului\u00bb.\n\u2022 \u00abLacrimi nepl\u00e2nse\u00bb (2015) \u2014 volum de 456 p., reune\u0219te poeme publicate \u00een 2010\u20132014 \u00een presa local\u0103; cartografie afectiv\u0103 a unei perioade social tensionate; dialog constant cu memoria locului (Gorj).\n\u2022 \u00abRadiografii spirituale\u00bb (2016) \u2014 256 p., cuprinde versuri ap\u0103rute \u00een 2015\u20132016 \u00een \u00abGorjeanul\u00bb, \u00abCaietele Columna\u00bb \u0219i \u00abMiracol de Br\u0103diceni\u00bb; reafirm\u0103 direc\u021bia etic\u0103 \u0219i civic\u0103 a autorului.\nEseuri \u0219i publicistic\u0103.\n\u2022 \u00abHo\u021bii de aripi\u00bb, vol. I (2001) \u2014 eseuri socio\u2011politice \u0219i istorice dedicate primului deceniu al tranzi\u021biei; autorul \u00eel define\u0219te drept \u00abJurnal al unei con\u0219tiin\u021be\u00bb. Discurs lucid, critic, orientat spre igiena moral\u0103 a cet\u0103\u021bii.\n\u2022 \u00abHo\u021bii de aripi\u00bb, vol. II (2006) \u2014 continu\u0103 \u00abradiografia\u00bb epocii p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 2001, pe urmele textelor publicate \u00een presa local\u0103; accent pe memorie, responsabilitate \u0219i educa\u021bie civic\u0103.\n\u2022 \u00abUpercuturi \u00een b\u0103rbia minciunii\u00bb (2006) \u2014 selec\u021bie de cuget\u0103ri, fabule, epigrame, microdialoguri din \u00abTimpul de Gorj\u00bb, peste 350 de pagini; Ion Popescu\u2011Br\u0103diceni vorbe\u0219te despre \u00abteroarea bunului\u2011sim\u021b\u00bb, un umor amar \u0219i acuzator, dar \u0219i despre pledoaria pentru modele morale.\n= Tematici, formule, influen\u021be \u0219i po(i)etic\u0103 =\nPoezia lui Ion D. Scorei mizeaz\u0103 pe concizie expresiv\u0103, rigoare formal\u0103 \u0219i echilibrul dintre abstract \u0219i concret. Haiku\u2011ul e tratat ca micro\u2011medita\u021bie: un singur nod imagistic catalizeaz\u0103 sensuri etice \u0219i ontologice. Sonetele \u00eenchid ideea \u00eentr\u2011o arhitectur\u0103 clasic\u0103, \u00eencerc\u00e2nd s\u0103 fixeze \u00aboglinzi mi\u0219cate\u00bb ale clipei. Poemul reflexiv favorizeaz\u0103 economiile lexicale \u0219i t\u0103cerile fertile.\nTransmodernitatea (aprecieri critice) se traduce \u00een epurarea stilistic\u0103, autocenzura calofil\u0103 f\u0103r\u0103 pre\u021biozitate, \u0219i gravitatea senin\u0103. Se remarc\u0103 interesul pentru memorie, timp, responsabilitate \u0219i rena\u0219tere moral\u2011civic\u0103.\n= Receptare critic\u0103 \u2014 antologie de aprecieri (selec\u021bie) =\n\u2022 Constan\u021ba Buzea (\u00een \u00abRom\u00e2nia literar\u0103\u00bb): un salut \u00abdezinvolt \u0219i optimist\u00bb; accent pe for\u021ba cuv\u00e2ntului \u0219i pe aura metafizic\u0103 a discursului liric.\n\u2022 Ion Popescu\u2011Br\u0103diceni (prefe\u021be/cronici): \u00abstilist pe spa\u021biu scurt\u00bb, \u00abgeometrii lucide\u00bb, fuziuni simbolice; \u00een publicistic\u0103, pledoarie pentru rena\u0219tere \u00een spirit democratic.\n\u2022 George Manoiu: \u00een \u00abOntosoneta\u00bb, rela\u021bia cu \u00abscurgerea implacabil\u0103 a timpului\u00bb; c\u0103utarea devenirii \u0219i a echilibrului \u00eentre idee \u0219i imagine.\n\u2022 Ion \u0218oldea (despre volumul de debut): autorul \u2014 \u00abc\u0103ut\u0103tor neobosit de pepite ale propriilor cuvinte\u00bb.\n\u2022 Alexandru Alex (despre \u00abHo\u021bii de aripi\u00bb I): atrage aten\u021bia \u00abc\u0103 \u00eenc\u0103 n\u2011am dep\u0103\u0219it grani\u021ba spre visul de dreptate \u0219i adev\u0103r\u00bb.\n= Biografie aprofundat\u0103, context \u0219i familie =\nR\u0103d\u0103cinile gorjene: T\u0103m\u0103\u0219e\u0219tii de Jos/Ceauru (azi B\u0103le\u0219ti) \u2014 matrice simbolic\u0103 \u0219i etic\u0103, revenind frecvent \u00een poemele publicate dup\u0103 2010.\nCariera la UM Sadu imprim\u0103 rigoare \u0219i disciplina formei; explorarea poetic\u0103 a timpului, memoriei \u0219i adev\u0103rului civic reflect\u0103 aceast\u0103 forma\u021bie.\n= Profil civic \u0219i publicistic =\nTextele din \u00abHo\u021bii de aripi\u00bb \u0219i \u00abUpercuturi \u00een b\u0103rbia minciunii\u00bb propun o etic\u0103 a cet\u0103\u021bii: luciditate critic\u0103, umor amar, refuzul derapajelor autoritare, chemare la igiena moral\u0103. Rubricile \u00abEseul s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2nii\u00bb \u0219i \u00abDin col\u021bul ironistului\u00bb fixeaz\u0103 un ton ferm, dar pedagogic, orientat spre valori democratice.\n\u00cen plan local, cenaclul \u0219i revista \u00abPuls\u00bb ofer\u0103 cadru pentru afirmarea tinerilor autori \u0219i jurnali\u0219ti, consolid\u00e2nd infrastructura cultural\u0103 \u00een Bumbe\u0219ti\u2011Jiu \u0219i Gorj.\n= Cronologie selectiv\u0103 a operelor (1993\u20132016) =\n\u2014 1993 \u2014 C\u0103r\u0103mizi pentru o catedral\u0103 (poezie)\n\u2014 1995 \u2014 \u00cen centrul luminii (antologie Cenaclul \u00abIon Minulescu\u00bb, \u00eengrijit\u0103 de autor)\n\u2014 1997 \u2014 Ce vede piatra (haiku; prefa\u021b\u0103: Ion Popescu\u2011Br\u0103diceni)\n\u2014 1999 \u2014 Alfabetul umbrei (poezie)\n\u2014 2001 \u2014 Ho\u021bii de aripi, vol. I (eseuri socio\u2011politice \u0219i istorice)\n\u2014 2001 \u2014 Fulgere fr\u00e2nte (haiku; aproape 1.000 de texte)\n\u2014 2003 \u2014 Muntele rotund. C\u0103l\u0103tor \u00een iluzie (haiku, edi\u021bie bilingv\u0103 ro/en; traducere: Silviu Doina\u0219 Popescu)\n\u2014 2004 \u2014 Ontosoneta. Oglinzi mi\u0219cate pe t\u0103i\u0219ul clipei (sonete; &gt;200 piese)\n\u2014 2006 \u2014 Ho\u021bii de aripi, vol. II (publicistic\u0103; p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 2001)\n\u2014 2006 \u2014 Upercuturi \u00een b\u0103rbia minciunii (cuget\u0103ri, fabule, epigrame, microdialoguri; selec\u021bie \u00abTimpul de Gorj\u00bb)\n\u2014 2015 \u2014 Lacrimi nepl\u00e2nse (456 p.; poeme 2010\u20132014)\n\u2014 2016 \u2014 Radiografii spirituale (256 p.; poeme 2015\u20132016)\n= Indice de periodice \u0219i colabor\u0103ri (selectiv) =\nReviste/lunare/s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2nale: \u00abConvorbiri literare\u00bb, \u00abFamilia\u00bb, \u00abRamuri\u00bb, \u00abLuceaf\u0103rul\u00bb, \u00abSuplimentul literar\u00bb, \u00abRom\u00e2nia literar\u0103\u00bb, \u00abGorjeanul\u00bb, \u00abDiminea\u021ba Gorjului\u00bb, \u00abJurnalul de Gorj\u00bb, \u00abOpinia\u00bb, \u00abCurierul minier\u00bb, \u00abMesager\u00bb, \u00abObiectiv gorjean\u00bb, \u00abTimpul de Gorj\u00bb, \u00abImpact \u00een Gorj\u00bb, \u00abInforma\u021bia Gorjului\u00bb, \u00abPuls\u00bb, \u00abCaietele Columna\u00bb, \u00abAger\u00bb, \u00abCuget liber\u00bb, \u00abMiracol de Br\u0103diceni\u00bb.\nRoluri: autor de rubrici, cronicar, eseist; \u00een unele redac\u021bii (ex. \u00abCurierul minier\u00bb, \u00abJurnalul de Gorj\u00bb) \u2014 redactor."}
{"id": "3254134", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3254134", "title": "Wuhan Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu", "text": "Wuhan Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii octombrie 2025. Dou\u0103zeci \u0219i opt de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Wuhan, China, jucat pe terenuri cu suprafa\u021b\u0103 dur\u0103. Anna Danilina \u0219i Irina Khromacheva au fost campioanele en-titre, dar au ales s\u0103 nu concureze \u00eempreun\u0103 anul acesta. Khromacheva a fost partenera Aldila Sutjiadi, dar au pierdut \u00een prima rund\u0103.\nStorm Hunter \u0219i Kate\u0159ina Siniakov\u00e1 le-au \u00eenvins \u00een final\u0103 pe campioana en-titre Anna Danilina \u0219i pe partenera ei Aleksandra Kruni\u0107, scor 6\u20133, 6\u20132, c\u00e2\u0219tig\u00e2nd titlul de dublu la Wuhan Open din 2025.\nSiniakov\u00e1 \u0219i-a p\u0103strat locul 1 \u00een clasamentul WTA la dublu dup\u0103 ce a ajuns \u00een semifinale. Taylor Townsend \u0219i Routliffe au fost, de asemenea, \u00een cursa pentru primul loc la \u00eenceputul turneului.\nCapi de serie.\nPrimii patru capi de serie au primit un bye \u00een runda a doua."}
